     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am getting an error: <div><strong>ERROR: &#39;restoreInput&#39; is not an exported object from &#39;namespace:shiny&#39;</strong></div><div><br></div><div>Have updated the version of shiny (to 1.0.3), prior to which I was forced to update \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"></p><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\">sourcetools - 0.1.6\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">I am still having this error. No where else in the code do I have a reference to restoreInput. I suppose this is called internally by one of the Input functions. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Is there a particular process I can follow to detect where the problem might be?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">- R version 3.3.3</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">- x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0pt\"></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
