   "subject": "Re: ERROR: 'restoreInput' is not an exported object from 'namespace:shiny'",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Do you have a reproducible example? restoreInput is a function that is used internally in Shiny. Also, if you recently updated the package, you should restart R to make sure that everything else is up to date.<div><br></div><div>If you first run options(error=recover) before starting your app, it will help you see where it is being called from.</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Aug 2, 2017 at 3:09 PM, Akshay Shembekar <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">optica...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
